  "blurb": "A fully furnished resale villa on more than 1,000 m² of freehold Chanote land on the Bang Por hillside, with an infinity pool and broad timber decks looking straight out across the Gulf. Four en-suite bedrooms over two levels, open-plan living with walls of glass, and a shaded sala. ฿36,000,000, with very good rental returns — figures on request.",
  "detail": "SPACE, LAND AND AN OPEN SEA VIEW\nHigh on the hillside above Bang Por, on Koh Samui's north coast, this villa sits on a generous 1,017.6 m² plot within a small community of contemporary pool villas. It is offered as a resale, fully furnished and ready to move into or rent out.\n\nOUTDOOR LIVING\nAn infinity pool runs along the edge of the terrace, with bean-bag loungers set in the shallows and the sea spread out beyond. Wide timber decks hold outdoor dining and lounge areas, alongside a timber-slatted sala and lawned terraces stepping down the hill.\n\nINSIDE\nThe main level is given over to open-plan living, dining and a modern kitchen with an island, together with the master suite and the pool — all behind floor-to-ceiling glass facing the sea. The lower level holds bedrooms two, three and four. All four bedrooms are en-suite, with four and a half bathrooms in all, finished in pale timber, soft whites and natural textures. Floor plans for both levels, the site and the roof are at the end of the gallery.\n\nINVESTMENT\nThe villa offers very good rental returns; ROI figures are available on request.\n\nKEY FACTS\n4 en-suite bedrooms · 4.5 bathrooms\nBuilt area 533 m² · living area 422 m² (indoor + outdoor)\nLand 1,017.6 m² · Chanote title · freehold\nInfinity pool facing the sea · sala & decks\nFully furnished · resale\nPrice: ฿36,000,000",
